  <data name="r__detail_radius_desc" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>This setting controls the maximum distance at which grass is rendered. The further the slider is moved, the further away the edge of the grass will be. ATTENTION! The game's grass rendering algorithm is such that increasing the grass radius increases the load on the video card exponentially. More or less acceptable values are in the range of 150-200 meters.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="r__detail_density_desc" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>This setting controls how tightly the grass bushes are drawn in the game. The further the slider is, the closer the grass elements will be drawn to each other and the thicker it will be. ATTENTION! Excessive density of grass leads to strong brakes, if you want to adjust this parameter, do it a little, each time checking what happened.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="r__detail_scale" xml:space="preserve">
