  <data name="r__smap_size" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Shadow map resolution</value>
  </data>
  <data name="r__smap_size_desc" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The higher the resolution of shadow maps, the clearer the shadows will be in the distance (more than ~15-20 meters from the GG - beyond the boundary of the near shadow cascade). To avoid noticeable deterioration in shadow quality at this boundary, it is recommended to set the resolution to at least 4096x4096. This setting has a significant impact on performance.</value>
